<title>USA: Central Tractor Farm sells $105 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Central Tractor Farm sells $105 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Central Tractor Farm &amp; Country Inc was priced on Thursday, according to sole manager Nationsbanc Capital Markets Inc.</p>
<p>Central Tractor is an agricultural speciality retailer.</p>
<p>BORROWER CENTRAL TRACTOR FARM &amp; COUNTRY INC</p>
<p>AMT $105 MLN	 COUPON 10.625 PCT MATURITY 4/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 10/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD  10.625 PCT PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 389 BPS    CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
